      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260706-f01-31-arena-free-bpf-next-v1-1-3ad6e7384285@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn/mbox/",
      "hash": "991999f0b2683c22ec6d1dbe28a59509e0c3e1f9",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "changes-requested",
      "submitter": "Nuoqi Gui",
      "date": "2026-07-06T15:52:10",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 bpf_arena_free_pages() 中地址越界检查缺失的问题。原先函数接收标量 arena 地址后，仅对末端按 arena->user_vm_end 裁剪后就插入空闲区间树，但若 full_uaddr 低于 arena->user_vm_start，会产生域外 page offset，后续分配可能从空闲树中消费该偏移并返回 arena 范围之外的地址。补丁新增一行判断：若计算出的完整用户地址低于 arena 起始地址则直接拒绝释放，从根源防止越界分配。属于 BPF arena 内存管理子系统的安全加固，仅改动 kernel/bpf/arena.c 两行代码。",
      "tags": [
        "eBPF",
        "包处理",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14667450,
      "title": "[net,v4,3/3] octeon_ep_vf: fix skb frags overflow in the RX path",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260706150208.2944898-4-maoyixie.tju@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260706150208.2944898-4-maoyixie.tju@gmail.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260706150208.2944898-4-maoyixie.tju@gmail.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "da4dea43154f57c6b57c668bc0f0f805069a802b",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Maoyi Xie",
      "date": "2026-07-06T15:02:08",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 Marvell Octeon EP VF 网卡驱动 RX 路径中 SKB fragments 数组溢出的安全漏洞。原代码在循环添加 SKB fragment 时没有检查 MAX_SKB_FRAGS 上限，长报文会产生约 18 个 fragments，超过默认的 17 个限制，导致 skb_add_rx_frag() 越界写入 shinfo->frags[]。修复方案是在调用 napi_build_skb() 之前检查 fragment 数量，超出限制则丢弃该报文。新增 octep_vf_oq_drop_rx() 辅助函数统一处理描述符释放、DMA unmap 和页面回收，确保丢弃路径不泄漏资源。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14667449,
      "title": "[net,v4,2/3] octeon_ep_vf: Fix RX page leak on napi_build_skb() failure",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260706150208.2944898-3-maoyixie.tju@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260706150208.2944898-3-maoyixie.tju@gmail.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260706150208.2944898-3-maoyixie.tju@gmail.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "f77f1532602a4a0214ce2e7cce67cae4b51aa6e1",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Maoyi Xie",
      "date": "2026-07-06T15:02:07",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 Marvell Octeon EP VF 网络驱动中 RX 路径的页面泄漏问题。在 __octep_vf_oq_process_rx() 函数中，当 napi_build_skb() 失败时，原本已经清空了 buff_info->page 但并未释放对应的页面引用，导致内存泄漏。同时在多片段（multi-fragment）场景下，后续片段页面的环槽位被清空时也缺少 put_page() 释放。补丁在两个失败分支中分别增加了 put_page() 调用，确保 head 页面和剩余 fragment 页面在错误路径下被正确回收，避免持续分配新页面导致的资源耗尽。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 14667448,
      "title": "[net,v4,1/3] octeon_ep: fix skb frags overflow in the RX path",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260706150208.2944898-2-maoyixie.tju@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260706150208.2944898-2-maoyixie.tju@gmail.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260706150208.2944898-2-maoyixie.tju@gmail.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "2ed25241872f46128e2f1cf43c49719a254559d4",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Maoyi Xie",
      "date": "2026-07-06T15:02:06",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 Marvell octeon_ep 网络驱动 RX 路径上的 skb 片段（frags）数组溢出问题。`buff_info->len` 来自设备响应头，未做边界检查，当多缓冲报文的 data_len 接近 65535 时，按 buffer_size（约 3776）切片会生成约 18 个 fragment，超过默认的 MAX_SKB_FRAGS=17，导致 `skb_add_rx_frag()` 越界写入 `shinfo->frags[]`。修复方案是在调用 `build_skb()` 之前通过 `DIV_ROUND_UP` 预计算所需 fragment 数量，超过上限则调用 `octep_oq_drop_rx()` 丢弃报文并消费描述符，与 `build_skb` 失败路径行为一致。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 14667192,
      "title": "[bpf-next,v4,4/9] libbpf: Drop in-loader metadata check for load-time verification",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260706135644.326006-5-daniel@iogearbox.net",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260706135644.326006-5-daniel@iogearbox.net/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260706135644.326006-5-daniel@iogearbox.net/mbox/",
      "hash": "545dcd6713afc6ca544e5e5599de544519628b54",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "changes-requested",
      "submitter": "Daniel Borkmann",
      "date": "2026-07-06T13:56:39",
      "summary": "该补丁重构了 libbpf 签名加载器（signed gen_loader）的元数据校验机制。此前，加载器需要在 BPF 内部通过硬编码的 struct bpf_map 偏移量读取 map->sha[] 并与签名指令中的哈希比对，需要额外的 BPF_OBJ_GET_INFO_BY_FD 往返。现在内核在 BPF_PROG_LOAD 时直接将 loader 的独占 fd_array maps 内容冻结并纳入签名验证，加载器自身不再做任何校验。由此移除了内核侧 struct bpf_map 的 excl 字段、对应的 BUILD_BUG_ON 布局检查以及 map->excl = 1 的设置，简化了 ABI 与签名链路，同时保留了 gen_hash 标记以防未信任主机篡改 map 维度或初始值。",
      "tags": [
        "eBPF",
        "性能",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
    {
