    {
      "id": 14667521,
      "title": "docs/bpf: Document BPF_STRICT_BUILD=0 to tolerate test build failures",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260706-b4-bpf_strict_build_docs-v1-1-5324d605c7b0@suse.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260706-b4-bpf_strict_build_docs-v1-1-5324d605c7b0@suse.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260706-b4-bpf_strict_build_docs-v1-1-5324d605c7b0@suse.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "6e1c1b4806657cd4137868b1583befcc7838d6e7",
      "commitRef": "575d4e50192d4ffdf1e41fd664571530e6eddc9e",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Ricardo B. Marlière",
      "date": "2026-07-06T15:28:43",
      "summary": "该补丁为 BPF selftests 构建文档补充了 BPF_STRICT_BUILD=0 选项的说明。当内核配置无法完全匹配 BPF selftests 配置片段时，部分测试可能编译失败。BPF_STRICT_BUILD 默认值为 1，会将任何编译失败视为致命错误；设为 0 则可容忍个别编译失败，继续构建剩余测试。该选项在 bringup 阶段或受限的发行版配置下尤为有用，避免因个别测试构建失败而中断整个测试套件的构建流程。",
      "tags": [
        "eBPF"
      ],
      "relevance": "medium",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 14662108,
      "title": "[net,9/9] netfilter: xt_connmark: reject invalid shift parameters",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260703125709.16493-10-fw@strlen.de",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260703125709.16493-10-fw@strlen.de/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260703125709.16493-10-fw@strlen.de/mbox/",
      "hash": "31b35da82d7e74c4f124420ec5911ed9c2adb8ea",
      "commitRef": "1b47026fb4b35bac850ad6e8a4ad7fc018e09ebc",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Florian Westphal",
      "date": "2026-07-03T12:57:09",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 netfilter xt_connmark 模块在 revision 2 中对用户态传入的 shift 参数校验缺失的问题。原代码允许 shift_bits ≥ 32（导致对 32 位 mark 值进行未定义移位操作）和非法 shift_dir 值（静默回退到左移路径），恶意或畸形规则可能在包处理路径触发 UB 或行为异常。修复方式是为 revision 2 新增 connmark_tg_check_v2 钩子，在规则加载阶段（checkentry）提前拒绝非法参数（shift_dir > D_SHIFT_RIGHT 或 shift_bits ≥ 32），返回 -EINVAL，避免异常规则进入数据包处理路径。",
      "tags": [
        "Netfilter",
        "包处理",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14662105,
      "title": "[net,6/9] netfilter: nft_set_rbtree: get command skips end element with open interval",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260703125709.16493-7-fw@strlen.de",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260703125709.16493-7-fw@strlen.de/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260703125709.16493-7-fw@strlen.de/mbox/",
      "hash": "e4e3e7e0ad95614501d6a59637fa2ab5f9fecd6a",
      "commitRef": "d63611cbe8af99dd61b118ee6e5b5e3e518250b2",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Florian Westphal",
      "date": "2026-07-03T12:57:06",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 netfilter nft 红黑树集合（nft_set_rbtree）在 get 命令处理开放区间时的 bug。当查找的结束元素落在开放区间内，且最接近的匹配是开放区间的起始元素时，原代码会错误地将起始元素作为结束元素的匹配结果返回给用户空间，导致用户空间收到重复匹配。修复方案是：在 nft_rbtree_get 中检测到 interval->to 为空（开放区间无闭合端点）时返回 NULL，并在 nf_tables_api.c 的 nft_get_set_elem 中对 elem.priv 为空的情况直接返回 0，不再通过 netlink 向用户空间发送任何匹配元素。",
      "tags": [
        "Netfilter",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14662104,
      "title": "[net,5/9] netfilter: ip6tables: mark malformed IPv6 extension headers for hotdrop",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260703125709.16493-6-fw@strlen.de",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260703125709.16493-6-fw@strlen.de/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260703125709.16493-6-fw@strlen.de/mbox/",
      "hash": "898ed91db64722b7fe10fc48bdddb436cf535b0a",
      "commitRef": "43ccc20b5a733226417832cf16ef45322e594990",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Florian Westphal",
      "date": "2026-07-03T12:57:05",
      "summary": "该 patch 修复了 netfilter ip6tables 中 IPv6 扩展头（AH、HBH、RT）匹配模块的安全漏洞。当报文声明的扩展头长度超过 skb 实际可用数据时（即畸形 IPv6 扩展头报文），原先匹配函数仅返回 false（视作规则不匹配），导致本应被 DROP 规则丢弃的畸形包可能绕过规则。补丁在 ip6t_ah.c 新增缺失的长度校验，在 ip6t_hbh.c 和 ip6t_rt.c 中将原有的长度校验加上 par->hotdrop = true，确保畸形包被强制丢弃而非放行，从而消除规则绕过风险。",
      "tags": [
        "Netfilter",
        "TCP/IP",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14662101,
